Package: com.hakmicapitalgroup.portal
Name: HCG Portal (Beta)
Version: 0.1.0~beta3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Free public beta demo. HCG Portal adds a luminous, interactive portal to the Lock Screen, below the clock and above notifications: a dark translucent centre with slowly turning cyan-and-violet energy rings. Tap it for a radial menu (Nexus, Backgrounds, Devices, HCG Apps); every destination asks for Face ID, Touch ID or your passcode first, and cancelling opens nothing. Adjustable position, size, colour, brightness, speed and intensity, with a live preview. Moves, shrinks or collapses around notifications, media controls, the flashlight and the camera. Off after installation; enable it in Settings. Lock Screen lifecycle hardening test build. Real-device verification pending.
Maintainer: Hakmi Capital Group
Author: Hakmi Capital Group
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Tag: purpose::extension, role::enduser
